            "summary": "This skill needs Review because it can handle wallet private keys, send live blockchain transactions, cache auth tokens, run background auto-replies, and has an overbroad authenticated API helper.",
            "dimensions": [
              {
                "detail": "The main SKILL.md does disclose Provider lifecycle workflows and on-chain transaction helpers, but the public description emphasizes inspection, auto-reply, reads, and dispute checks; the actual artifacts include minting agents, staking USDC, delivery settlement, generic REST mutations, and raw transaction broadcast.",
                "label": "Purpose & Capability",
