              {
                "detail": "The skill asks users to supply WALLET_KEY, LLM API keys, cached session/runtime tokens, file uploads, and RPC/network access. These are partly purpose-aligned but high-impact for a marketplace and wallet automation skill.",
                "label": "Credentials",
